Ultralytics YOLO26 and the ultralytics package (AGPL-3.0)
  The detector is downloaded and installed separately; it is not part of this
  repository. Software that distributes or serves this tracker together with the
  Ultralytics detector must meet the AGPL-3.0 terms. The detector sits behind
  the Detector protocol in src/yolo_kalman/detector.py and can be replaced.

